        "output": "i = 1, sum so far = 1\ni = 2, sum so far = 3\ni = 3, sum so far = 6\ni = 4, sum so far = 10\ni = 5, sum so far = 15\ni = 6, sum so far = 21\ni = 7, sum so far = 28\ni = 8, sum so far = 36\ni = 9, sum so far = 45\ni = 10, sum so far = 55\nFinal sum = 55"
