        "language": "cpp",
        "code": "#include <iostream>\n#include <unordered_map>\n#include <vector>\n#include <string>\n\nint main() {\n    std::vector<std::string> words = {\"cpp\", \"is\", \"fast\", \"cpp\", \"is\", \"fun\", \"cpp\"};\n    std::unordered_map<std::string, int> freq;\n\n    for (const std::string& w : words) {\n        freq[w]++;   // pehli baar: key banti hai, value 0 -> 1\n    }\n\n    std::cout << \"cpp appears \" << freq[\"cpp\"] << \" times\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"is appears \" << freq[\"is\"] << \" times\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"fun appears \" << freq[\"fun\"] << \" times\\n\";\n    std::cout << \"Total unique words: \" << freq.size() << \"\\n\";\n    return 0;\n}",
        "output": "cpp appears 3 times\nis appears 2 times\nfun appears 1 times\nTotal unique words: 4"
